Subject: [PATCH 2158/3799] soh: rename D_8090702C -> sSubCamEyeOffsets

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: per-step eye offsets added to the player's position when placing the sub-camera
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c     | 6 +++---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c    | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
index fddaa6279..a762a3d3c 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
@@ -1757,9 +1757,9 @@ void func_8090120C(BossGanon2* this, PlayState* play) {
                     player->actor.world.pos.z = 10.0f;
                     phi_a1 = 2;
                 }
-                this->subCamEye.x = D_8090702C[phi_a1].x + (player->actor.world.pos.x - 50.0f);
-                this->subCamEye.y = D_8090702C[phi_a1].y + (player->actor.world.pos.y + 50.0f);
-                this->subCamEye.z = D_8090702C[phi_a1].z + (player->actor.world.pos.z + 40.0f);
+                this->subCamEye.x = sSubCamEyeOffsets[phi_a1].x + (player->actor.world.pos.x - 50.0f);  // was D_8090702C [LLM:HIGH]
+                this->subCamEye.y = sSubCamEyeOffsets[phi_a1].y + (player->actor.world.pos.y + 50.0f);  // was D_8090702C [LLM:HIGH]
+                this->subCamEye.z = sSubCamEyeOffsets[phi_a1].z + (player->actor.world.pos.z + 40.0f);  // was D_8090702C [LLM:HIGH]
                 this->subCamAt.x = D_80907050[phi_a1].x + player->actor.world.pos.x;
                 this->subCamAt.y = D_80907050[phi_a1].y + (player->actor.world.pos.y + 40.0f);
                 this->subCamAt.z = D_80907050[phi_a1].z + player->actor.world.pos.z;
